<title>LEBANON: Lebanon electricity workers to stage strike.</title>
<headline>Lebanon electricity workers to stage strike.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public electricity workers in Lebanon will hold a one-day strike on Tuesday, state-run television said on Monday.</p>
<p>The television said electricity workers' syndicates announced the &quot;warning&quot; strike. It did not specify how many workers would take part.</p>
<p>Antoine Bsharah, chairman of the Independent Syndicate of Public Utility Workers, told Reuters that some 2,500 electricity workers would stage the strike to demand pay rises.</p>
</text>
